  "Le programme, appelé pour {f}, x⁽⁰⁾ = {x0} et x⁽¹⁾ = {x1}, affiche les incréments |x⁽ᵏ⁺¹⁾ − x⁽ᵏ⁾| :": "The program, called for {f}, x⁽⁰⁾ = {x0} and x⁽¹⁾ = {x1}, prints the increments |x⁽ᵏ⁺¹⁾ − x⁽ᵏ⁾|:",
