  "L'ordre est strictement entre 1 et 2": "The order is strictly between 1 and 2",
  "La méthode est d'ordre 1, puisque δₖ/δₖ₋₁ tend vers 0": "The method has order 1, since δₖ/δₖ₋₁ tends to 0",
