  "On interpole f(x) = {f} sur [0 ; {b}] en {n1} nœuds équirépartis. Quelle borne donne max|f⁽ⁿ⁺¹⁾|/(4(n + 1))·hⁿ⁺¹ ?": "We interpolate f(x) = {f} on [0 ; {b}] at {n1} equispaced nodes. What bound does max|f⁽ⁿ⁺¹⁾|/(4(n + 1))·hⁿ⁺¹ give?",
