  "Avec h = 1/N et xᵢ = ih (i = 0 … N − 1), ∫₀¹ f(x) dx = {f}·Σᵢ ∫₋₁¹ f(xᵢ + h(t + 1)/2) dt.": "With h = 1/N and xᵢ = ih (i = 0 … N − 1), ∫₀¹ f(x) dx = {f}·Σᵢ ∫₋₁¹ f(xᵢ + h(t + 1)/2) dt.",
  "Vrai : sur [xᵢ ; xᵢ + h], x = xᵢ + h(t + 1)/2 donne dx = (h/2)dt.": "True: on [xᵢ ; xᵢ + h], x = xᵢ + h(t + 1)/2 gives dx = (h/2)dt.",
  "Faux : dx = (h/2)dt, le facteur est h/2 (avec h, on obtient le double).": "False: dx = (h/2)dt, the factor is h/2 (with h, you get twice the value).",
